
# Subject: <type>(<scope>): <short summary> (max 50 chars)
# Types: feat | fix | docs | style | refactor | perf | test | build | ci | chore | revert
#
# Body (optional):
# - Background / Problem:
# - Changes:
# - Impact / Breaking Changes:
#
# Footer (optional):
# Refs #123
# Docs: docs/xxx.md

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Example:
# feat(auth): add token refresh API
#
# - Background: Expired tokens forced users to log out.
# - Changes: Added /refresh endpoint to return a new access token.
# - Impact: None.
#
# Refs #123